        "@value": "Join us at #BollywoodMonster Mashup - One of Canada’s BIGGEST South Asian festivals, featuring FREE concerts with international Bollywood stars, a food festival, dance performances, shopping, and more! Come dance, sing and feast with us at this one-of-a-kind production taking place at Mississauga Celebration Square!"
